      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771831848423,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "①去掉空格，分解成有定义的token",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "①去掉空格，分解成有定义的token",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_SikzSsoVfK3bILhOq2jg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2201.2465292782244,
      "y": -1913.7358423832363,
      "width": 637,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 58407245,
      "version": 293,
      "versionNonce": 2022783437,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771832549811,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "②把这些token根据这个操作符放到一个数据结构(一般是语法树结构)中",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "②把这些token根据这个操作符放到一个数据结构(一般是语法树结构)中",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UGtcVfGIBYZlF1ZJvSQL4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2212.032399101656,
      "y": -1877.2724686595259,
      "width": 351,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 642795149,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 1894782595,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771832552999,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "树的结构=天然解释了表达式的执行顺序",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "树的结构=天然解释了表达式的执行顺序",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HK2Z0MteMgYuP6TD-VQ7v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1954.2047424433197,
      "y": -1736.9441101901393,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 768909293,
      "version": 360,
      "versionNonce": 28254765,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771832581058,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "③可以再把这个树结构转化成一个字符串结构",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "③可以再把这个树结构转化成一个字符串结构",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9aRRKJSqNFl-E3TKvhj6b",
