      "updated": 1771841192981,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ABI",
      "fontSize": 47.92514270375859,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ABI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GY1byH6ZBdcS7IirLhLLt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.94397736648716,
      "y": -2180.884968994559,
      "width": 985.46875,
      "height": 48,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bCz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 919075971,
      "version": 48,
      "versionNonce": 363304995,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771840585664,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ABI 定义了在二进制可执行文件级别，程序如何与操作系统、库或其他二进制组件交互。\nABI 是给编译器和链接器 用的，它们生成的目标文件、可执行文件必须遵循目标平台的 ABI，才能正确运行。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ABI 定义了在二进制可执行文件级别，程序如何与操作系统、库或其他二进制组件交互。\nABI 是给编译器和链接器 用的，它们生成的目标文件、可执行文件必须遵循目标平台的 ABI，才能正确运行。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "JIZ3PkLSxzM6gFZf43x7o",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 190.60866890337573,
      "y": -2186.6830887204806,
      "width": 997.8040580966241,
      "height": 59.596238720480414,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 821247363,
      "version": 165,
      "versionNonce": 702979011,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771840585664,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "mRLjr8kHHknOjI24xnEEi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 212.96680206969972,
      "y": -2104.9626858756833,
      "width": 694.0625,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1436902691,
      "version": 45,
      "versionNonce": 1388587875,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771840585664,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "函数调用约定（参数如何传递、返回值如何获取、栈如何清理）。\n数据类型的大小、对齐方式和内存布局（例如 long 是 32 位还是 64 位）。\n结构体/类的填充和布局规则。\n系统调用号（例如 Linux 上 syscall 指令的参数约定）。\n动态链接库的符号解析规则、全局符号的命名修饰（name mangling）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "函数调用约定（参数如何传递、返回值如何获取、栈如何清理）。\n数据类型的大小、对齐方式和内存布局（例如 long 是 32 位还是 64 位）。\n结构体/类的填充和布局规则。\n系统调用号（例如 Linux 上 syscall 指令的参数约定）。\n动态链接库的符号解析规则、全局符号的命名修饰（name mangling）。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "WPzW-e5nPbrc3H6XRD2F7",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 190.608669,
      "y": -2118.626940673772,
      "width": 716.4206330000002,
      "height": 150.30689213616301,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1952013187,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 344901379,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771840585664,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "grynJkT3F-jo34zAvbcdn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.9439768480005,
      "y": -1951.7477432028877,
      "width": 1421.25,
      "height": 96,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 756586253,
      "version": 31,
      "versionNonce": 1707404963,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771840585664,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "例子\nLinux 的 x86-64 ABI 规定了函数调用的前几个参数通过寄存器（rdi, rsi, rdx, rcx, r8, r9）传递，其余通过栈传递\n不同编译器（如 GCC 和 Clang）如果遵循相同的 ABI，编译出的对象文件就可以互相链接。\n操作系统内核通过系统调用接口（属于 ABI 的一部分）提供服务：应用程序执行 int 0x80 或 syscall 指令并传入特定的调用号，内核据此执行相应操作。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "例子\nLinux 的 x86-64 ABI 规定了函数调用的前几个参数通过寄存器（rdi, rsi, rdx, rcx, r8, r9）传递，其余通过栈传递\n不同编译器（如 GCC 和 Clang）如果遵循相同的 ABI，编译出的对象文件就可以互相链接。\n操作系统内核通过系统调用接口（属于 ABI 的一部分）提供服务：应用程序执行 int 0x80 或 syscall 指令并传入特定的调用号，内核据此执行相应操作。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "EyKlQAJAFo2WoxMwu4HhS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 202.9439768111236,
      "y": -1839.1754365969396,
      "width": 958.59375,
      "height": 48,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bD6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 976589453,
      "version": 18,
      "versionNonce": 906198093,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771840606128,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "二进制兼容：\n如果 ABI 保持不变，一个已经编译好的二进制程序可以在不同版本的系统或库上直接运行，无需重新编译。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "二进制兼容：\n如果 ABI 保持不变，一个已经编译好的二进制程序可以在不同版本的系统或库上直接运行，无需重新编译。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
