      "versionNonce": 446736237,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771841194317,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ABI 是二进制层面的接口，确保二进制可移植（编译一次，到处运行）。",
